    "long_instructions": "## Run Your Tests\r\n\r\nThis program is the vending machine from your activity guide. Do not change the code yet.\r\n\r\nFor each row of your table:\r\n1. Type the number from the Input column and press Enter.\r\n2. Read what the program prints. Write it in the Actual result column.\r\n3. Compare it to your Expected result. Mark Pass if they match, Fail if they don't.\r\n\r\nWhen every row is marked, answer the question under your table: which row failed?"
  },
